   "latex": "As $P(2\\ \\&\\ 2)=P(12\\ \\&\\ 12)$ etc.\n\n$$P(\\text{Same})=2\\times\\left[P(2\\ \\&\\ 2)+P(3\\ \\&\\ 3)+P(4\\ \\&\\ 4)+P(5\\ \\&\\ 5)+P(6\\ \\&\\ 6)\\right]+P(7\\ \\&\\ 7)$$\n\n$$=2\\times\\left[\\dfrac{1^2}{36^2}+\\dfrac{2^2}{36^2}+\\dfrac{3^2}{36^2}+\\dfrac{4^2}{36^2}+\\dfrac{5^2}{36^2}\\right]+\\dfrac{6^2}{36^2}$$\n\n$$=\\dfrac{73}{648}$$",
